sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Citizen
    participant Client as Browser / Client (AppointmentPage)
    participant ApptAPI as Next.js API (/api/appointments)
    participant SlotMgr as Slot Manager (lib/slotManager)
    participant FSM as FSM Engine (lib/fsm.ts)
    participant Prisma as Prisma Client (lib/prisma.ts)
    participant DB as Database (Appointment/Center)

    Citizen->>Client: View PSK slots for chosen date
    Client->>ApptAPI: GET /api/appointments/slots?centerId=...&date=...
    activate ApptAPI

    ApptAPI->>SlotMgr: getAvailableSlots(centerId, date)
    activate SlotMgr
    SlotMgr->>Prisma: Query center capacity & existing bookings
    Prisma->>DB: Aggregation query
    DB-->>Prisma: Booked count per slot
    SlotMgr-->>ApptAPI: Array of available slots
    deactivate SlotMgr

    ApptAPI-->>Client: 200 OK (Slots available)
    deactivate ApptAPI

    Citizen->>Client: Select Slot & Confirm Booking
    Client->>ApptAPI: POST /api/appointments { applicationId, slot }
    activate ApptAPI

    ApptAPI->>Prisma: Verify application fee status (PAYMENT_COMPLETED)
    Prisma-->>ApptAPI: Valid

    ApptAPI->>SlotMgr: Check slot capacity
    SlotMgr-->>ApptAPI: Capacity available

    ApptAPI->>FSM: canTransition("PAYMENT_COMPLETED", "APPOINTMENT_BOOKED")
    FSM-->>ApptAPI: Allowed

    ApptAPI->>SlotMgr: generateQueueToken() -> "TOK-A-108"
    SlotMgr-->>ApptAPI: Token generated

    ApptAPI->>Prisma: $transaction(create appointment & update application)
    activate Prisma
    Prisma->>DB: INSERT Appointment (status: BOOKED, token: TOK-A-108)
    Prisma->>DB: INSERT AppointmentHistory
    Prisma->>DB: UPDATE Application (status: APPOINTMENT_BOOKED)
    Prisma->>DB: INSERT ApplicationStatusHistory
    DB-->>Prisma: Committed
    Prisma-->>ApptAPI: Completed record
    deactivate Prisma

    ApptAPI-->>Client: 201 Created { tokenNumber, appointmentSlipUrl }
    deactivate ApptAPI

    Client-->>Citizen: Render Appointment Slip with QR code
